@node C2 "R E Q U I R E M E N T S..."

                                  BYTEKILLER v1.4
                              
Package of MST-BK13.lha :
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
         
         doors:Bytekiller/Bytekiller                /X tool for NUKING
                         /Bytekiller.info           .info for configuration
                         /BytekillHandler           BytekillHandler as cli-tool
                         /FakeMessage/              dir for UserComments
                         /Bulls/                    dir for BullCreator
         
                                    /X 3.+ Version Reg.


@endnode
@node C1 "I N T R O D U C T I O N..."
         
     What BYTEKILLER is able to :
     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
     
     CREAT FAKE-FILE :
     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
     If BYTEKILLER don`t find the Name of the File what you have insert,
     he Ask if you want creat the File as FakeFile!

     FREEDOWNLOAD :
     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
     BYTEKILLER can make some FreeDownloads if you Want!

     FAKING :
     ~~~~~~~~
     BYTEKILLER makes it for normal people possible to FAKE files (means
     they can write a comment to a file telling it is fake or old or...)
     just like in the old AMIFAKER from TRSI.
     
     The sysop is able to search for those comments by using function "F"
     of BKv1.4 and is able to nuke those files. The user can be given
     a definated percent of the nuked files as upload bytes by the sysop.
     
     NUKING :
     ~~~~~~~~
     Function "I" of BKV1.4 makes it possible to type in as many files
     as the computer allows. Now it is possible to nuke files with autonuke
     mode (especially for nuking multiple disk releases in a amazing time or
     giving 2* credits for majors ...) or in single mode or even make
     FREEDOWNLOAD. To make a autonuke mode possible the tooltype "AUTONUKE" is
     required.

     Bytekiller Suports the CONF_ACCOUNTING for User !
     
     If the NewFiles V2.5 is out, you can Flag there Files to Nuke it with 
     the Bytekiller V1.4, BosNuke will insert the Same Option, so don`t be
     worry if you mostly Like BosNuke!

     Furthermore it is possible to make all nuke comments in the filelisting
     in different colors and styles. So it is for example possible to
     place a comment in "italic with green text on blue background"
     thats simply generated with "3;44;32".
     
     Special greetins to Dr.Dre! for this idea and Remo of Mystic for the
     configurating idea.
     
     Why using Bytekiller and not "%§+/&" :
     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

      WELL AFTER YOU SAW IT ONE TIME YOU WILL KNOW WHY ! IT IS THE FUCKING 

                                  B.E.S.T. !


@endnode
@node C3 "I N S T A L L A T I O N ..."

SETTING UP :
~~~~~~~~~~~~

The Bytekillhandler in the archive should be started in the logoffscript
of each of the nodes.

EXAMPLE:

BytekillHandler <path of callerslog of node>

This program makes sure that this nuker will find the uploader in a faster
periode than BOSSNUKE without the need of being started in a FILECHECK.INFO.
Either this program generates a datafile that take space on your HD away !

It just writes behind every file the usernumber of the uploader what makes
this nuker to the fastest in finding the uploader.


Copy the Directory of Bytekiller in your Doors: Directory and start 
Bytekiller as XIM Door!

@endnode
@node C5 "T O O L T Y P E S ..."

                      @{"         NUKER            " LINK NUKER}
                      @{"      NUKER.<Number>      " LINK NUKER.<Number>}
                      @{"      NUKER_PW.<1-x>      " LINK NUKER_PW.<1-x>}
                      @{"   ACCESS_FREE.<Nummer>   " LINK ACCESS_FREE.<Nummer>}
                      @{"    ACCESS_DEL.<Nummer>   " LINK ACCESS_FREE.<Nummer>}
                      @{"       NODE.<0-x>         " LINK NODE.<0-x>}
                      @{"    COMMENT.<1-998>       " LINK COMMENT.<1-998>}
                      @{"     SIZE.<1-998>         " LINK SIZE.<1-998>}
                      @{"     EXTERN_COMMENT       " LINK EXTERN_COMMENT}
                      @{"      CREATE_DATAS        " LINK CREATE_DATAS}
                      @{"        AUTONUKE          " LINK AUTONUKE}
                      @{"     GREAT_MESSAGE        " LINK GREAT_MESSAGE}
                      @{"     SHORT_MESSAGE        " LINK SHORT_MESSAGE}
                      @{"        BOSSDATA          " LINK BOSSDATA}
                      @{"    USER_FAKE_MESSAGE     " LINK USER_FAKE_MESSAGE}
                      @{"     ACCOUNT_PER_CONF     " LINK ACCOUNT_PER_CONF}
                      @{"       TAKE_COLOR         " LINK TAKE_COLOR}
                      @{"       USER_COLOR         " LINK USER_COLOR}
                      @{"       FREE_COLOR         " LINK FREE_COLOR}
                      @{"       GIVE_COLOR         " LINK GIVE_COLOR}

@endnode
@node NUKER "NUKER ..."

                 NUKER=<what amount of Nuker or "ALL"> 

         If this is ALL, all user with a level selected in 
         "bbs:commands/bbscmd/nuke.info" can start the nuker !
   But "USER_FAKE_MESSAGE=<percent>" is not possible anymore in this case !

@endnode
@node NUKER.<Number> "NUKER.<Number> ..."

                        NUKER.<Number>=<NukerName>

    Is "NUKER=<1-x>" selected, so everyone allowed to nuke must get a number
    and at "NUKERNAME" must be his user name !

@endnode

@node NUKER_PW.<1-x> "NUKER_PW.<1-x>...."

                         NUKER_PW.<1-x>=<Password>

             If available it will ask for a personell password !
             Not needed.
@endnode


@node ACCESS_FREE.<Nummer> "NUKER.<Number> ..."

                          ACCESS_FREE.<Nummer>
                          ACCESS_DEL.<Nummer>

To allow a special user to delete and make FreeDownload files.

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
                            ACCESS_FREE
                            ACCESS_DEL

allows all users with his Name in the .info File to delete files or make 
them freedownload 

it is only possible to use one of these tooltypes.

per user "ACCESS_FREE.<Nummer>" or for ALL users in the List "ACCESS_FREE"

@endnode
@node NODE.<0-x> "NODE.<0-x>..."

                     NODE.<0-x>=<full path for Callerslog> 

All nodes with callerslog or udlog path. The nodes must be writen from
"0-x", if "NODE0" is local node you have to write for NODE1 :

NODE.0=<full path for Callerslog>

@endnode
@node COMMENT.<1-998> "COMMENT.<1-998>...."

                  COMMENT.<1-998>=<Comments for the Filelisting>

           There are 1-998 different comments possible you can type.
           The options NONE and OTHER are done by the nuker himself.

@endnode
@node SIZE.<1-998> "SIZE.<1-998>...."

            SIZE.<1-998>=<Comments for the Size in the List>

              Same as COMMENT just for the BYTECOMMENTS

@endnode
@node EXTERN_COMMENT "EXTERN_COMMENT......"


                            EXTERN_COMMENT

   allows 5 more lines for the uploader that will be in the nukermessage.

               !!!  NOT POSSIBLE IN AUTONUKE MODE.  !!!

@endnode
@node CREATE_DATAS "CREATE_DATAS....."

                           CREATE_DATAS

This will create extern datafiles with the users who got nuked and allows
the nuker to see the list of the nuked user.

It is possible to make bulls out of these datas.

               Please use " BuLLCReaToR V1.0 " by Siegel/mst

@endnode
@node AUTONUKE "AUTONUKE....."

                             AUTONUKE

This allows to nuke alot of files at one time (WILDCARDS, after 3 letters
always allowed)

In this mode all needed options will be asked by the nuker and used on
all the files after.

@endnode
@node GREAT_MESSAGE "GREAT_MESSAGE......"

                            GREAT_MESSAGE

Writes a big message to the up/down-loader in old NOSNUKE style with more
informations.

@endnode
@node SHORT_MESSAGE "SHORT_MESSAGE...."

                             SHORT_MESSAGE 

          Writes messages in Old BOSNUKE format with more informations.

@endnode
@node BOSSDATA "BOSSDATA....."

                               BOSSDATA

If you still don´t trust my filehandler you can use the old one from bosnuke
and let udlog.x as filecheck.info work.

@endnode
@node USER_FAKE_MESSAGE "USER_FAKE_MESSAGE........."

                        USER_FAKE_MESSAGE=<1-100%>

Allows user to write a message in filelisting and for that getting (IF the
file gets nuked) a percent <1-100%> of bytes of the nuked file. There will
be no message writeen to the user about that. Only the first user that
noticed the fake will get credits.

@endnode
@node ACCOUNT_PER_CONF "ACCOUNT_PER_CONF...."

                           ACCOUNT_PER_CONF

     If one or more user got ConfAccounting you will need this tooltype.

@endnode
@node TAKE_COLOR "TAKE_COLOR...."

                            TAKE_COLOR=36       

Will show a comments with option "TAKEN" in a special color. Here blue.

@endnode
@node USER_COLOR "USER_COLOR......"

                            USER_COLOR=44       

Same as take_color just for the USER COMMENTS.

@endnode
@node FREE_COLOR "FREE_COLOR......"

                            FREE_COLOR=3;31     

      Same as take_color but will show FREEDOWNLOAD in special colors
      Here red and italic.

@endnode
@node GIVE_COLOR "GIVE_COLOR....."

                            GIVE_COLOR=3;44;32

    Same again but for option "GIVEN" here italic, blue background and 
    green letters.
@endnode

@node C6 "Changes....."


BytekillerV1.3

            I have removed the Mover Option, because the programm is 
            now to Complex to include this option again!

            Changes by the Uploader Search, 
            three-Way search : BOSDATA, Bytekillhandler and Callerslog!
            I think Bytekiller is in ALL ways The Fastes UP-DownLoader searcher!

            Changes by the msgroutine....to many sysops Fake`s in her
            msgbase!

            Installed AutoNuke and Faker modus

            Installed the option to Add Colors in the DirListing

            Install two options for the Messages to the Up-Downloader

            I have changed the menu options because some sysops have written
            that they are to stupid to understand the options!

BytekillerV1.4

            removed the Bug in the Fake from list Option!



@endnode
